{
  "uid": "pagent-adoption",
  "title": "Pagent — Adoption",
  "tags": ["pagent", "adoption", "product"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "time": { "from": "now-7d", "to": "now" },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Renders (1h / 24h / 7d)",
      "description": "Pages fetched by the renderer (pagent_pages_viewed_total) — the north-star 'active render' signal.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 18, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "options": { "textMode": "value_and_name", "colorMode": "value" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(increase(pagent_pages_viewed_total[1h]))",
          "legendFormat": "1h",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(increase(pagent_pages_viewed_total[24h]))",
          "legendFormat": "24h",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(increase(pagent_pages_viewed_total[7d]))",
          "legendFormat": "7d",
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "barchart",
      "title": "Funnel: created → viewed → submitted (24h)",
      "description": "Top-of-funnel (created) → render (viewed) → activation (submitted).",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 6 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(increase(pagent_pages_created_total[24h]))",
          "legendFormat": "created",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(increase(pagent_pages_viewed_total[24h]))",
          "legendFormat": "viewed",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(increase(pagent_pages_submitted_total[24h]))",
          "legendFormat": "submitted",
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Render rate (per 5m)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 6 },
      "targets": [
        { "expr": "rate(pagent_pages_viewed_total[5m])", "legendFormat": "renders/s", "refId": "A" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Render → submit activation (24h)",
      "description": "Of pages that rendered, the share that got a user submission. Pre-v2 proxy for activation (no per-user identity yet).",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 14 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 30 },
              { "color": "green", "value": 60 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": { "colorMode": "background" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "100 * sum(increase(pagent_pages_submitted_total[24h])) / clamp_min(sum(increase(pagent_pages_viewed_total[24h])), 1)",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "barchart",
      "title": "Renders by format (24h)",
      "description": "show_ui (a2ui) vs show_html demand.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 14 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (format) (increase(pagent_pages_viewed_total[24h]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{format}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "About this dashboard",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 14 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**North-star: active renders.** `pagent_pages_viewed_total` counts every page the renderer fetches — the closest server-side signal for 'the user saw the UI'.\n\n**Pre-v2 limitation:** true *weekly active renderers* and *repeat rate* need per-user identity. Those land in **stage 2**, after v2 auth adds `owner_id` — then add per-owner active-renderer and week-2 repeat panels here.\n\nDo **not** treat raw counts as adoption in isolation — watch the render→submit activation and the created→viewed→submitted funnel shape."
      }
    }
  ]
}
